window.__T__=[{"i":4720,"text":"Subject and Composition\nA minimalist and elegant Jummah Mubarak greeting card design centered on a serene architectural composition. The scene features the iconic white dome and two minarets of Al-Masjid an-Nabawi rendered in a clean, sophisticated aesthetic. A subtle, modern elevator glass lift is integrated into the side of the mosque structure, featuring sleek brushed steel and transparent glass panels that reflect the surrounding courtyard light. Tiny, graceful silhouettes of birds are scattered near the dome, adding a sense of movement and scale.\n\nTypography and Calligraphy\nAt the top, prominent bold black Arabic calligraphy reads Jummah Mubarak, with the English translation placed directly underneath in a crisp, modern sans-serif font. At the bottom, exquisite Arabic calligraphy displays the Quranic verse فَإِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا, followed by its English transliteration and the text So, surely with hardship comes ease, maintaining a clear and balanced visual hierarchy.\n\nLighting and Atmosphere\nSoft, diffused daylight creates a calm and spiritual atmosphere, emphasizing the clean lines of the architecture. The lighting is high-key and even, avoiding harsh shadows to maintain a professional, corporate, and modern feel. The air feels crisp and still, with a sense of quiet reverence.\n\nMaterial and Color Palette\nThe background is a textured light grey, reminiscent of high-end stationery or premium paper stock. The color palette is strictly monochromatic grayscale, utilizing subtle gradients and clean whites, deep blacks, and soft greys to ensure a cohesive and sophisticated look.\n\nConstraints\nNo oversaturated colors, no vibrant neons, no plastic textures, no distorted architectural elements, no blurry or low-resolution text, no extra watermarks or logos. Ensure the calligraphy is sharp and legible, and the integration of the lift is seamless and architecturally consistent.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/20644_out.png"]},{"i":4721,"text":"Nike × Billie Eilish — \"RAW MOTION\"\n\nFORMAT: Ultra-Premium Streetwear SMM Poster | 4:5 | Instagram Hero | Behance Front Page Quality\nCORE STRATEGY: High-contrast movement. Bold typography and kinetic human energy.\nCAMPAIGN: \"RAW MOTION\"\nMASTER VISUAL: Massive NIKE swoosh and wordmark (70% canvas) with neon green graphics.\nHERO SUBJECT: Billie Eilish. Dark grey track jacket, volt green sneakers, baggy athletic trousers.\nPOSE: Stepping forward mid-action, low-angle perspective, direct eye contact.\nCOLOR SYSTEM: Dark Charcoal, Neon Volt Green, Cold Grey, Chalk White.\nBACKGROUND: Urban brutalist concrete backdrop with motion-blurred street lights.\nGRAPHIC SYSTEM: Stenciled numbers, technical collection labels, layered utility tags.\nPROMOTIONAL ELEMENTS: NIKE × EILISH | VOLT COLLECTIVE | LIMITED DROP\nTYPOGRAPHY: Top left swoosh | Center giant N I K E | Title: RAW MOTION\nLIGHTING: Cyberpunk green key light from the side, harsh white rim light on the jacket.\nCAMERA: ARRI Alexa Mini LF, 35mm wide-angle lens, low-angle camera position.\n\nAdidas × Jenna Ortega — \"THREE STRIPES NOIR\"\n\nFORMAT: Ultra-Premium Streetwear SMM Poster | 4:5 | Instagram Hero | Behance Front Page Quality\nCORE STRATEGY: Clean retro-cool. Bold brand stripe lines frame the model.\nCAMPAIGN: \"THREE STRIPES NOIR\"\nMASTER VISUAL: Giant ADIDAS trefoil logo and text (70% canvas) in chalk white.\nHERO SUBJECT: Jenna Ortega. Classic black track jacket with white shoulder stripes, dark hair.\nPOSE: Standing sideways, looking back over her shoulder with a relaxed gaze.\nCOLOR SYSTEM: Carbon Black, Chalk White, Muted Red accent, Slate.\nBACKGROUND: Dark red brick warehouse wall, out of focus.\nGRAPHIC SYSTEM: Thin grid lines, retro collection labels, stripe geometry alignments.\nPROMOTIONAL ELEMENTS: ADIDAS ORIGINALS | RETRO TRACK SERIES | BUY NOW\nTYPOGRAPHY: Top left trefoil logo | Center giant A D I D A S | Title: THREE STRIPES NOIR\nLIGHTING: Soft natural daylight from the side, highlighting the fabric stripes.\nCAMERA: ARRI Alexa Mini LF, 85mm Lens, shallow depth of field.\n\nPuma × Neymar Jr. — \"STREET FORCE\"\n\nFORMAT: Ultra-Premium Streetwear SMM Poster | 4:5 | Instagram Hero | Behance Front Page Quality\nCORE STRATEGY: Gritty urban action. Neon colors and concrete textures.\nCAMPAIGN: \"STREET FORCE\"\nMASTER VISUAL: Monolithic bold PUMA typography (70% canvas) in bright yellow.\nHERO SUBJECT: Neymar Jr. Black techwear hoodie, neon yellow sneakers, holding a black soccer ball.\nPOSE: Squatting on a concrete floor, balancing the ball under his hand, direct gaze.\nCOLOR SYSTEM: Neon Yellow, Charcoal, Slate Grey, White.\nBACKGROUND: Underpass concrete pillars with yellow security lights.\nGRAPHIC SYSTEM: Spray-paint stencils, collection barcodes, grid dividers.\nPROMOTIONAL ELEMENTS: PUMA STREETWEAR | VOLT COLLECTION | SHOP ONLINE\nTYPOGRAPHY: Top left jumping cat logo | Center giant P U M A | Title: STREET FORCE\nLIGHTING: High-contrast harsh streetlamp lighting, yellow rim light on the hoodie.\nCAMERA: ARRI Alexa Mini LF, 50mm Lens, wide perspective, high contrast\n\nNew Balance × Jack Harlow — \"GREY COMFORT\"\n\nFORMAT: Ultra-Premium Streetwear SMM Poster | 4:5 | Instagram Hero | Behance Front Page Quality\nCORE STRATEGY: Clean collegiate aesthetic. Soft neutral tones and grey textures.\nCAMPAIGN: \"GREY COMFORT\"\nMASTER VISUAL: Classic blocky NEW BALANCE logo (70% canvas) in vintage grey.\nHERO SUBJECT: Jack Harlow. Grey wool knit sweater, off-white trousers, New Balance 9060 sneakers.\nPOSE: Leaning against a concrete column, hands in pockets, looking off-camera with a smile.\nCOLOR SYSTEM: Classic Grey, Cream, Soft Navy, Ivory.\nBACKGROUND: Minimalist university campus courtyard with stone pillars.\nGRAPHIC SYSTEM: Clean grid lines, athletic badge graphics, clean sans-serif text lists.\nPROMOTIONAL ELEMENTS: NB 9060 SERIES | CLASSIC RUNNER | ONLINE EXCLUSIVE\nTYPOGRAPHY: Top left wordmark | Center giant N E W B A L A N C E | Title: GREY COMFORT\nLIGHTING: Bright overcast daylight, soft diffused shadows, natural textures.\nCAMERA: ARRI Alexa Mini LF, 75mm Lens, warm cinematic grading","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/20530_out.png"]},{"i":4722,"text":"A premium 9:16 vertical street advertising poster. \nMain theme: Centered composition featuring the model from Image 1 as the focal point, standing directly in the middle. \nPose: Maintains the same posture as shown in Image 1, delivering strong fashion promotional impact. \nDesign style: A fusion of modern streetwear brand aesthetics and luxurious editorial graphic design. \nBackground: Vibrant, saturated red studio backdrop. \nGraphic layer: A massive oversized typeface displaying \"BREAKING CAMP,\" dominating most of the background—heavily cropped with parts hidden behind the model. \nTop-right corner features a sticker-style label clearly stating \"August 1st–10th.\" \nBottom-left corner includes clear text: \n\"10:00–12:00 Physical Training + FREEZE Intensive\" \n\"13:30–17:30 FOOTWORK + POWER + Creative Clips\" \n\"19:00–22:00 Review Content + Combat Training\" \nThe overall layout includes subtle negative space. \nAdditional graphic elements: White graffiti brushstrokes, dynamic marker lines, sticker-style stars, abstract geometric symbols, small barcode motifs, and a delicate papercut collage texture. \nComposition: Strong central subject, poster-style design, Instagram-trending aesthetic, modern youth culture branding. \nLighting: High-contrast studio lighting with sharp shadows, achieving high-end fashion photography quality. \nAtmosphere: Bold, confident, youthful—highly eye-catching. \nColor palette: Deep red, white, black. \nAspect ratio: 9:16 vertical format. Fashion promotional poster. Editorial magazine style. Extremely detailed. An 8K masterpiece.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/20393_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/20393_in0.png"]},{"i":4723,"text":"A premium 9:16 streetwear editorial advertising poster.Main Subject:A confident young male model standing in the exact center of the composition.Pose:Arms crossed.Direct eye contact.Strong attitude.Fashion campaign presence.Outfit:Oversized bright-red varsity jacket.White heavyweight t-shirt.Black cargo pants.Clean white sneakers.Design Style:Modern streetwear branding mixed with luxury editorial graphic design.Background:Vibrant saturated red studio backdrop.Graphic Layer:Huge oversized typography reading:\"NO LIMITS\"The typography occupies most of the background, heavily cropped by the frame, partially hidden behind the model.Additional Graphic Elements:White graffiti strokes.Dynamic marker lines.Sticker-style stars.Abstract geometric symbols.Small barcode elements.Subtle paper-cut collage textures.Composition:Strong central subject.Poster-first design.Instagram-viral aesthetic.Modern youth-culture branding.Lighting:High-contrast studio lighting.Crisp shadows.Premium fashion photography quality.Mood:Bold.Confident.Youthful.Attention-grabbing.Color Palette:Intense red.White.Black.Aspect Ratio:9:16 vertical.Fashion campaign poster.Editorial magazine aesthetic.Ultra detailed.8K masterpiece.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19984_out.png"]},{"i":4724,"text":"A young adult woman crouches on rain-wet city stone pavement at night, photographed from above with a close-range phone snapshot feeling. She is centered in the frame, lower than the camera, looking upward into the lens, like a casual three-frame social-media photo taken by a friend after a nighttime cosplay event. The composition is a long vertical phone screenshot or collage ratio, with the wet pavement taking up most of the background and warm streetlamp reflections surrounding her.\n\nShe has deep black long straight hair falling below the chest, with airy bangs and natural face-framing strands. The hair looks smooth, dark, and slightly glossy under low night light, with mild softness around the edges from phone night photography. She wears a black cat-ear headband with pointed ears, slightly leather-like or matte in reflection. Keep her face rounded and sweet, with bright eyes and a cute interactive expression: one image can show a wink, another direct eye contact, another a slightly open-mouth playful look. Her makeup is inspired by East Asian anime-influenced gothic cute styling: fair translucent base, pink blush centered on the face, clean eyeliner, visible lashes, and soft red-pink lips with a slight night-flash glow.\n\nShe wears a black camisole or short cosplay-style top with thin straps and a low neckline, with silver graphics, sequins, or small reflective details on the chest. The top remains covering and outfit-focused. Around her neck is a black choker with silver metal ring, studs, or a small pendant, and a dark bracelet on the wrist. The lower outfit is a black mini skirt or short bottom paired with black strappy legwear, torn fishnet-style stockings, or crossing strap tights. The straps wrap around the thighs and knees, creating irregular cutout shapes. She wears black platform shoes. The leg straps are a major visual identity, creating a strong gothic cute look against the reflective wet pavement.\n\nVisible skin includes the face, neck, shoulders, arms, hands, partial collarbone area, knees, sections of thighs, and skin showing through the strappy legwear. The waist, abdomen, back, and buttocks are not visible. Her skin tone is fair and cool, appearing slightly pink-white under phone fill light and nighttime street lighting. The skin should feel soft and smooth, like cool skin in humid night air, with phone-night-shot softness on arms and legs while still preserving real texture. Avoid plastic skin smoothing.\n\nThe pose is a low catlike crouch: both knees bent and opened outward, feet planted, body weight low. One hand supports her on the wet pavement while the other hand is lifted near her face in a cat-paw gesture, with fingers curled or slightly spread. Another variation can place both hands on the ground, like a cat about to pounce. The action should feel cute, playful, slightly mischievous, not like a polished studio pose.\n\nThe photography style must feel like a phone night street snapshot, not a commercial studio shoot. The camera looks down from roughly 45 to 60 degrees above her, using a phone wide-angle feel around 24mm to 28mm equivalent, with moderate depth of field so both the subject and nearby wet pavement remain mostly clear. Keep mild night-camera noise, dark-area smearing, compression artifacts, and slight edge blur. Lighting is a mix of warm yellow streetlamps and close cool-white phone fill light: the streetlamps create golden reflections on the rain-wet stone tiles, while the phone light brightens her face, arms, knees, and exposed leg areas, creating a contrast between cool pale skin and warm reflective pavement. Keep the background simple: wet stone tiles, tile seams, warm reflections, dark patches, and possibly a phone casually placed near the right edge of the frame.\n\nAvoid making the subject look underage, avoid oversexualization, avoid explicit exposure, avoid daytime studio lighting, avoid ultra-clean commercial sharpness, avoid plastic doll skin, avoid real animal ears, avoid complex backgrounds, and do not remove the warm reflections on the wet pavement.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19979_out.png"]},{"i":4725,"text":"Jill Valentine from Resident Evil, illustrated in a Kubo Tite-inspired thick paint style with elegant, high-contrast rendering. Side-profile half-body composition, gaze to the left, regal and composed expression. Deep burgundy background with soft gradient depth and large negative space. Premium editorial poster aesthetic, subtle rim lighting, low-saturation palette, sharp facial structure, detailed hair strands, and refined skin texture. Minimal but dramatic layout with bold title typography. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19615_out.png"]},{"i":4726,"text":"Rebecca Chambers from Resident Evil, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19488_out.png"]},{"i":4727,"text":"A young adult woman lying on a soft rug and white faux-fur blanket, captured with an intimate home-photo feeling and natural sunlight. The subject sits slightly lower than center, with the body stretching upward in the frame and the bent legs close to the lens creating strong foreground perspective.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19280_out.png"]},{"i":4728,"text":"一位身姿高挑、体态健美、身材比例完美的东方少女。她左手叉腰，右手紧握一柄烈焰中国长剑，帅气站立。少女留着齐刘海，一头黑红渐变的超长卷发如火焰披风般垂落至地面、随风舒展。身着硬挺机能面料打造的宽松工装外套，衣身棱角分明、褶皱利落；内搭短款战术露脐上衣，下身是多口袋工装阔腿裤，周身点缀多款未来风实用配饰。手臂处配有线条简约流畅的赛博义体部件，服饰与机械构件的融合比例恰到好处。流动艺术家的姿态，利落的步法，克制的专注力","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19226_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19226_in0.png"]},{"i":4729,"text":"超细致的动漫角色海报，英雄联盟金克丝，画面右侧的半脸特写肖像，强烈的眼神交流，被电影般的边缘光照亮的奢华飘逸发丝，背景是奇幻冒险世界，受角色旅程和个性启发的史诗环境，发光粒子，氛围深度，戏剧性的体积光影，高度细致的皮肤和发丝，鲜艳的色彩分级，杰作动漫插画，竖版海报构图，优雅的字体，左侧的日式书法笔触，角色名字纵横显示，励志名言，高级收藏海报设计，奇幻现实主义，电影级景深，虚幻引擎质量，ArtStation 热门，超锐利对焦，8K 分辨率。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19141_out.png"]},{"i":4730,"text":"naah™️. Act as a Fashion Photographer and Graphic Designer specializing in luxury brand campaign visuals with integrated typography and surreal spatial design.\n\nPHASE 1: SPATIAL CONCEPT\n\nCreate a high-fashion editorial image where architecture and graphic design merge into a theatrical stage. The foundation is a bold geometric floor pattern that extends into forced perspective, creating infinite depth and visual drama. This is not a neutral backdrop – the floor is a protagonist that amplifies brand identity through pattern, color, and spatial illusion.\n\nPHASE 2: CHECKERBOARD ARCHITECTURE\n\n- Surface: Checkerboard/geometric tile pattern rendered in brand-relevant colors\n\n- Perspective: Aggressive forced perspective starting from bottom foreground and receding toward horizon (vanishing point at upper third of frame)\n\n- Pattern Logic: Autonomously determine pattern based on naah™️:\n\n- Color Palette: Incorporate 2-3 signature colors of naah™️ into floor pattern while maintaining readability\n\n- Texture: Photorealistic rendering with subtle reflections and shadows for depth\n\nPHASE 3: MODEL & STYLING\n\n- Subject: One fashion model (gender-fluid casting) captured mid-motion – dynamic pose suggesting walking, running, or dancing\n\n- Outfit: Elevated monochrome look (black, white, or brand-neutral tone) to let floor pattern and typography dominate. Include 1-2 key accessories in naah™️'s signature color as hero product focal points\n\n- Pose Energy: 70% movement, 30% control – fashion-forward but grounded (avoid floating/unnatural levitation)\n\n- Placement: Model positioned in lower-mid frame, interacting spatially with both floor perspective and typography layer\n\n- Camera Angle: Low-to-mid angle (waist-to-full body shot) to emphasize floor perspective drama\n\nPHASE 4: TYPOGRAPHY INTEGRATION\n\n- Brand Script: Oversized handwritten/script version of naah™️ rendered as flat graphic element behind or around the model\n\n- Scale: Typography should be 40-60% of frame width – bold and unmissable but not crushing the model\n\n- Color: Signature brand color (autonomously selected), solid fill with clean edges\n\n- Interaction: Typography appears to \"sit\" in the space – model may partially overlap letters, creating layering hierarchy\n\n- Logo Lockup: Clean, small brand logo centered in upper portion of frame (10-15% of width) in black or brand color\n\n- Treatment: Pure vector aesthetic – no gradients, no shadows, no dimensional effects. Flat color only.\n\nPHASE 5: COLOR ORCHESTRATION (AUTONOMOUS)\n\nAutonomously research and apply naah™️'s iconic color system:\n\n- Primary: Identify 1-2 hero brand colors (e.g., Gucci → forest green + red, Tiffany → robin egg blue)\n\n- Application: Use primary colors in floor pattern AND typography for visual cohesion\n\n- Balance: 60% white/neutral space, 30% brand color saturation, 10% black for anchoring\n\n- Accent: Hero product (bag, shoes, accessory) should echo brand color for strategic eye-pull\n\nPHASE 6: LIGHTING & ATMOSPHERE\n\n- Lighting Setup: High-key fashion lighting with soft shadows – think editorial studio quality\n\n- Key Light: 45° front-left to sculpt model, creating gentle shadows on checkerboard\n\n- Fill: Ambient fill to prevent harsh contrast while maintaining drama\n\n- Floor Treatment: Subtle specular highlights on floor tiles for luxury sheen (not glossy/mirror-like)\n\n- Background: Pure white or subtle gradient to white at horizon line – maintains clean editorial feel\n\nPHASE 7: TECHNICAL EXECUTION\n\n- Mood: Playful luxury – sophisticated but not stiff, energetic but refined\n\n- Composition Rule: Dynamic diagonal lines (floor perspective) + vertical anchor (model) + horizontal balance (typography)\n\n- Depth Layers: Background (white) → Typography (mid-ground) → Model (foreground) → Floor pattern (spanning all depths)\n\n- Post-Production: Magazine-cover polish with color grading that enhances brand palette\n\nTECHNICAL SPECS:\n\n- Camera Simulation: Phase One XF IQ4 150MP, 80mm lens, f/5.6 for controlled depth\n\n- Aspect Ratio: 4:5 (Instagram editorial) or 3:4 (print campaign)\n\n- Resolution: 8K output, print-ready sharpness\n\n- Color Space: sRGB with vibrant saturation for digital, slight desaturation for luxury print feel\n\n- Style Reference: Gucci campaigns by Glen Luchford, Prada visuals, Highsnobiety x luxury collabs, Vogue Italia editorials\n\n- Rendering: Photorealistic model and floor, graphic-design-quality typography (hybrid aesthetic)","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19138_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/19138_in0.png"]},{"i":4731,"text":"A 9:16 vertical late-night candid smartphone-style image, showing a fictional Jujutsu Kaisen anime crossover scene.\n\nThe protagonist stands in the central foreground, presented from an extremely close first-person / selfie-like perspective, shot with an iPhone 0.5x ultra-wide night camera. Satoru Gojo, Kento Nanami, Suguru Geto, Shoko Ieiri, and Mei Mei surround the protagonist in a semi-circle formation.\n\nOne of the protagonist’s hands is placed in the extreme foreground, holding an unlit cigarette between the index and middle fingers. The tobacco tip points outward toward the surrounding lighter flames, while the filter end stays closer to the protagonist’s mouth and hand. The cigarette becomes the focal point that all the lighters are pointing toward.\n\nThe surrounding characters all lean slightly toward the camera, each extending one hand forward while holding a lit lighter, as if they are all trying to light the protagonist’s cigarette at the same moment. Because of the ultra-wide perspective, the foreground hands, cigarette, and lighters are exaggerated in size, creating strong pressure and spatial depth.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/18858_out.png"]},{"i":4732,"text":"赛博朋克：边缘行者 露西娜・库希纳达 角色海报，站在高楼天台上。极致仰拍蠕虫视角构图。整体风格融合了半写实动漫美学与 UE5 的超写实渲染。\n角色的服装、发型、配饰、材质、姿态、神情、光影、色调、符号系统与版式语言，全部依据角色本身自动推导，确保角色辨识度强、视觉系统专属、主题一眼可识别，不使用固定模板，不统一做成同一种风格换皮。 画面以角色为唯一核心主体，构图居中或微偏中心，背景自动生长出最契合该「主题名称」的完整世界观、标志性场景、角色关系、象征符号、关键建筑、生物、道具与氛围。 排版自动生成少量最契合角色的短标语、编号、注释或纵向信息，采用高级极简 typography，字距疏朗、结构克制、现代而冷静，是画面设计的一部分，不喧宾夺主，不做廉价杂志大字排版。 服饰得体，仅做合理镂空设计，不低俗暴露。 背景是与角色相呼应的环境，氛围狂野又危险。画面底部是风格化标题 “角色英文名”，下方英文标注 “角色常用简短台词”，整体光影对比强烈，细节丰富，8K 超清。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/18254_out.png"]},{"i":4733,"text":"Create an ultra-premium cinematic automotive poster artwork in square format (1:1).\n\nREFERENCE IMAGE RULE:\nUse the uploaded vehicle image as the exact design reference.\n\nPreserve:\n• original car body shape\n• proportions\n• aerodynamic lines\n• wheels\n• headlights\n• unique design identity\n• paint color personality\n\nDo NOT redesign the vehicle.\nDo NOT replace the car.\nOnly enhance the environment, lighting, presentation, and advertising style.\n\n────────────────────\nCAR INFORMATION:\n────────────────────\n\nBrand:\n[ماركة السيارة]\n\nModel:\n[موديل السيارة]\n\nCategory:\n[Concept Car]\n\nMain title text:\n\"[CAR BRAND]\"\n\"[MODEL NAME]\"\n\nSubtitle:\n\"[CUSTOM VEHICLE TAGLINE]\"\n\nExample:\nTHE FUTURE RUNS ELECTRIC.\nTHE SOUL REMAINS LEGENDARY.\n\n────────────────────\nMAIN SCENE:\n────────────────────\n\nPlace the vehicle in a surreal premium automotive advertising environment:\n\nEnvironment theme:\n[Pink cherry blossom forest / futuristic city / desert luxury scene / mountain road / studio / custom theme]\n\nCreate:\n• cinematic depth\n• foreground elements partially covering the car naturally\n• shallow depth of field\n• luxury editorial magazine feeling\n• dramatic perspective\n• realistic reflections\n• high-end automotive photography style\n\nCamera:\nLow angle professional automotive shot.\n85mm lens feeling.\nUltra realistic details.\n\n────────────────────\nTYPOGRAPHY DESIGN:\n────────────────────\n\nCreate bold luxury automotive typography integrated into the scene.\n\nAdd a huge artistic handwritten / futuristic text behind the car displaying:\n\n\"[MODEL NAME]\"\n\nStyle:\n• large scale\n• premium racing identity\n• white / metallic typography\n• partially hidden behind vehicle\n• modern concept-car reveal feeling\n\nAdd small technical specification icons section at the bottom:\n\n────────────────────\nVEHICLE SPECIFICATIONS:\n────────────────────\n\nPOWERTRAIN:\n[مواصفات السيارة المشهورة]\n\n────────────────────\nCOLOR IDENTITY:\n────────────────────\n\nMain vehicle color:\n[لون السيارة]\n\nUse matching accent colors from the vehicle:\n• UI lines\n• icons\n• typography details\n• reflections\n\n────────────────────\nPOSTER STYLE:\n────────────────────\n\nInspired by:\n• luxury automotive launch campaigns\n• hypercar reveal posters\n• futuristic concept presentations\n• premium magazine covers\n\nQuality:\n• ultra realistic\n• 8K automotive render\n• ray tracing reflections\n• cinematic lighting\n• sharp details\n• luxury commercial photography\n\nFinal result must look like an official manufacturer reveal campaign poster.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17927_out.png"]},{"i":4734,"text":"A bold branding poster with a lone dark silhouette against a glowing crimson red background. Two blurred shadow profiles appear behind the head, suggesting dual identity and inner voices. High contrast red and black lighting, minimal white logo mark, bold uppercase typography, cinematic editorial style, film grain, clean Swiss layout.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17926_out.png"]},{"i":4735,"text":"A high-quality editorial toner cartridge poster split into a 2x2 grid layout, each quadrant featuring one iconic cartridge with a bold typographic name as the background. Top-left: Pantum PD213 in Cobalt Blue, side profile view, floating above its reflection, massive \"PANTUNM\" text behind in matching blue tones, cobalt blue panel background, small detail inset photos of exploded drawings and chips in the corner, editorial body copy below the car. Top-right: Pantum CTL2100 in golden yellow, side profile, \"CTL2100\" in massive serif bold letters behind it. Bottom-left: Pantum PD400 in Championship Red, aggressive front-three-quarter angle, massive \"PD400\" text melting into the dark red background, dramatic low-angle lighting, small thumbnail of front grille and wing spoiler. Bottom-right: Pantum CTL350 in burnt orange/rust tone, side profile, \"CTL350\" in oversized bold condensed font. All four panels have a dark bottom section with white serif editorial description text, small divider lines, and 2–3 small square detail photos. Overall layout: vertical 9:13 poster, magazine-editorial aesthetic, graphic design studio quality, toner cartridge illustration meets print poster art. Ultra photorealistic, 8K, no text overlays, cinematic color grading.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17830_out.png"]},{"i":4736,"text":"Shot on ARRI Alexa Mini LF, 35mm lens, dynamic commercial perspective, street-fashion energy, magazine-cover quality detail, natural movement capture, authentic contemporary fashion realism, premium advertising production standards.\n\nModern fashion campaign color grading, strong reds, clean whites, visible fabric textures, realistic skin detail, subtle grain, commercial social-media polish, no artificial luxury grading, no fashion-house minimalism, no generic fast-fashion campaign aesthetics, no AI slop, no sterile studio appearance.\n\nA fusion of Spotify Wrapped energy, Nike youth-culture storytelling, Pinterest trend aesthetics and world-class graphic design agency execution. Bold, energetic, expressive, commercial, social-first and highly shareable. A true promotional SMM poster communicating that every personality, every mood and every version of yourself can exist within one H&M collection. Behance Front Page quality, award-winning youth-fashion advertising, graphic-design-first commercial masterpiece.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17719_out.png"]},{"i":4737,"text":"H&M \"STYLE FOR EVERY VERSION\" Ultra-Premium Fashion SMM Promotional Poster, Vertical 4:5, Instagram Hero Campaign, Global Fashion Advertising, Commercial Fashion Graphic Design, Youth Culture Marketing, Agency-Level Art Direction, Behance Front Page Quality, 8K UHD, Hyper-Realistic, Fashion × Graphic Design Fusion, social-first advertising, energetic commercial design, identity-driven storytelling, H&M sells possibility rather than clothing, one collection expressing multiple personalities, campaign built around individuality, self-expression, confidence, versatility and personal style.\n\nThe entire composition feels like multiple social media posts colliding together into one high-impact visual system, dynamic layered collage aesthetic, modern youth-culture advertising, oversized typography integrated into photography, overlapping design elements, disruptive layouts, editorial cutouts, digital-native graphic design language, movement and energy throughout the frame, inspired by Spotify Wrapped, Nike youth campaigns, Pinterest trend reports, magazine covers and modern social media design systems.\n\nFour distinct H&M personalities occupy different zones of the composition. Look 01: Streetwear girl wearing oversized denim jacket, baggy cargo pants, white sneakers, confident stance, urban energy, trend-driven styling. Look 02: Minimalist woman wearing monochrome tailoring, clean silhouette, effortless sophistication, modern confidence, understated styling. Look 03: Creative male wearing layered overshirt, relaxed trousers, street-inspired fashion, artistic energy, contemporary styling. Look 04: Weekend casual look featuring graphic tee, denim, lightweight jacket, relaxed attitude, approachable confidence. All characters represent different versions of the same generation, demonstrating multiple identities within one H&M collection.\n\nMassive oversized condensed typography dominates nearly 70% of the composition. The words STYLE FOR EVERY VERSION occupy the majority of the frame. Typography interacts directly with subjects, some letters overlapping people, some disappearing behind clothing, some extending beyond the frame boundaries, large-scale disruptive layout, energetic visual hierarchy, graphic design functioning as a primary storytelling device rather than decoration.\n\nBold H&M red dominates the visual environment, large white graphic blocks, layered fashion graphics, subtle paper textures, torn-paper collage effects, editorial cutout treatments, modern digital design language, dynamic depth created through overlapping visual layers, contemporary social media aesthetic.\n\nTop left official H&M logo. Massive central typography: STYLE FOR EVERY VERSION. Campaign headline: YOUR STYLE. YOUR RULES. Supporting copy: The latest collection for every side of you. Promotional CTA block: SHOP NOW → Explore New Arrivals. Feature strip: WOMENSWEAR • MENSWEAR • ACCESSORIES • NEW ARRIVALS. Bottom right: UP TO 40% OFF. Bottom center: www.hcoVertical edge text: H&M SUMMER 2026.\n\nIntegrated promotional elements include NEW ARRIVALS, SUMMER DROP 2026, UP TO 40% OFF, ONLINE EXCLUSIVE, LIMITED STOCK, FREE SHIPPING, MEMBERS GET EARLY ACCESS, TRENDING NOW. Editorial labels and social proof elements distributed throughout composition including Trending Now, Most Loved, Editor's Picks, Best Sellers, New This Week, Styled By Thousands. Premium hierarchy, modern retail psychology, commercial fashion marketing intelligence.\n\nColor palette built around H&M red, white, black, denim blue, cream and selective seasonal color accents. High contrast visual system, bold brand recognition, youthful energy, modern commercial fashion aesthetic, immediate social-media impact.\n\nBright commercial fashion lighting, clean highlights, rich fabric detail, realistic material textures, natural skin rendering, youthful optimistic atmosphere, authentic expressions, candid movement, premium campaign photography.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17716_out.png"]},{"i":4738,"text":"vertical smartphone video frame, realistic Korean adult woman in a cozy home outfit standing slightly left of center, plain cream-colored wall background, warm circular yellow spotlight behind her, soft indoor lighting, casual social media cosplay transformation video atmosphere, 9:16 vertical phone-camera realism, slight compression texture\n\nthe woman keeps the same appearance as the previous frame: long straight black hair, subtle Korean idol-style makeup, gentle confident smile, golden snake-shaped earrings, white fitted tank top, light pink cardigan resting naturally on her shoulders, comfortable high-waisted lounge shorts, hands gently behind her back, relaxed front-facing pose\n\non the right side, a semi-transparent floating outfit reference image appears, like a selectable cosplay option overlay, showing Boa Hancock's classic One Piece empress outfit: elegant red and pink Chinese-style dress, high side slit but not revealing, gold ornamental patterns, pale sash around the waist, white cape-like shoulder drape, large golden snake earrings, long black hair, graceful pirate empress silhouette, anime character reference card feeling, about 55 percent opacity, softly blended into the scene, slight glowing edge, positioned in the previously empty right-side space\n\nat the top, a clean white rectangular title banner with bold tall black condensed text: \"BOA HANCOCK\", thin gold border, small pink heart accents, subtle snake motif, pirate-empress ornamental corners, readable centered title\n\nkeep the main woman realistic and fully opaque, keep the right-side Boa Hancock outfit image semi-transparent, no physical interaction yet, clean background, warm playful transformation mood, the frame should clearly suggest a canon character outfit selection has just appeared","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17711_out.png"]},{"i":4739,"text":"Theme: Four goddesses ruling four cosmic kingdoms\nUltra-premium K-pop comeback visual featuring a four-member global girl group as celestial rulers of separate dimensions. Multi-panel luxury editorial layout combining giant moon discs, floating celestial circles, and vertical cosmic banners.\nEach member controls a kingdom:\n\nCrimson Sun Queen (Red / Fire / Ambition)\nPlatinum Moon Oracle (Silver / Destiny / Silence)\nSakura Star Empress (Pink / Seduction / Influence)\nSapphire Galaxy Commander (Blue / Order / Power)\n\nVisual language: black space, liquid gold constellations, floating planets, celestial architecture, luxury fantasy couture.\nColors: crimson red, platinum silver, cosmic pink, sapphire blue, antique gold.\nTypography: royal serif + celestial symbols.\nMood: \"Ancient mythology meets futuristic luxury empire.\"","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17654_out.png"]},{"i":4740,"text":"伽罗 from Kings of Glory, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17592_out.png"]},{"i":4741,"text":"分析 X 个人资料的截图，并制作以【NATU】为标题的高端美容与文化杂志的封面。请从个人资料中自动生成编辑主题、特辑标题、标题和文案。\n标题应以占表皮30～50%的巨型排版形式配置，采用文字与人物重叠的大胆布局。请充分利用强烈的跳跃率、留白设计、大小对比、非对称布局，打造以排版为主导的编辑设计。\n这不是社交媒体横幅广告；这是一本高端杂志的封面，人们会想在书店里拿起来翻阅。它应该拥有媲美时尚和奢侈化妆品广告的摄影质量、精致的色彩设计，以及足够多的标题和信息层级，才能称得上是一本合格的杂志。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17446_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17446_in0.png"]},{"i":4742,"text":"Patrick Star wearing a sharp black suit, white shirt, red tie, and black sunglasses, serious heroic expression with subtle comedic charm, Rembrandt lighting setup, a single strong beam of light illuminating only half of his face while the rest falls into deep shadow, overall dark moody tone, intense light and shadow contrast, horizontal motion blur trails behind the character to create a sense of high-speed movement, pure black background, cinematic poster quality, rich details, dramatic lighting, white minimalist typography in the lower-left corner reading “NATIONAL FLAG GUARD FOR OUR GLORY”, 3:2 aspect ratio, 8K, high-quality animated cinematic render","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17444_out.png"]},{"i":4743,"text":"Mr. Krabs wearing a sharp black suit, white shirt, red tie, and black sunglasses, powerful serious boss-like expression, Rembrandt lighting setup, a single strong beam of light illuminating only half of his face while the rest falls into deep shadow, overall dark moody tone, intense light and shadow contrast, horizontal motion blur trails behind the character to create a sense of high-speed movement, pure black background, cinematic poster quality, rich details, dramatic shadows, white minimalist typography in the lower-left corner reading “NATIONAL FLAG GUARD FOR OUR GLORY”, 3:2 aspect ratio, 8K, high-quality animated cinematic render","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17443_out.png"]},{"i":4744,"text":"Vertical 9:16, realistic everyday home interior, fixed camera, left-right comparison composition, TikTok cosplay transformation final keyframe style. The scene takes place inside the same ordinary but believable Korean apartment living room or bedroom entrance, warm white walls, light wooden floor, beige sofa corner. Clean lived-in home atmosphere, no clutter, no messy room, not a photo studio, not a pure white studio setup.\n\nOn the left side stands an adult Rem-inspired anime female character reference, full body visible, standing on the same room floor as if she is physically present in the scene, not a poster, not on the wall, no paper border, no tape. She is a clean high-quality 2D anime maid character with short soft light-blue hair, neat side-swept bangs partly covering one eye, large gentle blue eyes, delicate elegant face, black-and-white maid outfit with frilled apron, puff sleeves, ribbon details, thigh-high white stockings, black shoes, calm loyal sweet aura, strong recognizable Rem identity. Add a subtle contact shadow under her feet, making her feel like a clean anime standee or character illustration standing inside the real room. Place clear English text beside her: “Rem”.\n\nOn the right side is the same adult Korean woman around 25 years old, now fully transformed into a realistic live-action Rem-inspired cosplay version matching the left character. She has a short soft light-blue cosplay wig with neat side-swept bangs partly covering one eye, a delicate maid headband with small white flower details, bright gentle eyes, natural fair skin, subtle glossy makeup, and a cute sweet elegant expression. She wears the same black-and-white maid costume as the left Rem character: black fitted maid dress, white frilled apron, puff sleeves, white lace trim, black ribbon at the collar, decorative bow details, thigh-high white stockings, and black Mary Jane-style shoes. Full body visible, standing on the wooden floor in a pose similar to the left anime character, hands softly placed in front of her body, shoulders relaxed, shy cute smile, calm loyal sweet aura. She looks like the completed live-action transformation result, matching the anime reference while still feeling like a real adult Korean cosplay model. Blue eyes\n\nAt the top of the image, add a clustered comic-style headline in blue, white, and black that reads “REM TRANSFORMATION COMPLETE”, slightly tilted, with manga speed lines, small snowflake icons, maid-ribbon sticker effects, sparkle burst effects, and impact sticker effects, but do not cover the face. Bright realistic home lighting, warm natural window light, full-body framing, left side standing 2D anime character reference, right side live-action final transformed Rem cosplay woman, strong social media video thumbnail impact, realistic smartphone capture, clean but lived-in apartment details, high facial beauty, memorable live-action cosplay transformation final cover.\n\nNegative no poster, no wall print, no framed artwork, no paper texture on the anime character, no white studio background, no floating character, no cropped legs, no blurry face, no messy room, no excessive clutter, no dirty floor, no unrealistic studio lighting, no nudity, no lingerie, no explicit pose, no transparent fabric, no underage appearance, no childlike body, no face change from previous keyframes, no different woman, no warped hands, no extra fingers.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17422_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17422_in0.png"]},{"i":4745,"text":"Create an ultra-premium modern Japanese street-art editorial poster featuring [BEAST GOHAN] as the main subject. Automatically analyze the characters's identity, public image, branding, fashion style, personality, career, fan culture, visual aesthetics, iconic colors, and overall vibe. Generate a unique color palette that perfectly matches the artist. Do not use fixed colors. The entire design, accents, typography highlights, stickers, graffiti, and visual elements must adapt naturally to the artist. Style combines Japanese street culture, Harajuku fashion, Y2K aesthetics, luxury editorial design, collectible idol merchandise, retro internet graphics, magazine cover layouts, modern pop-art, graffiti art, and premium streetwear branding. Background uses clean premium paper texture with subtle print imperfections, vintage editorial details, and modern magazine aesthetics. Place massive oversized black typography behind the subject displaying the artist's first name as the primary graphic element. Overlay the typography with a huge graffiti-style handwritten version of the artist's name using colors derived from the artist's visual identity. Main Subject: High-quality cutout portrait of [BEAST GOHAN]. Absolute facial accuracy. Center composition. Natural pose. Professional studio lighting. Fashion campaign quality. Premium magazine-cover presence. Street-Art Elements: Graffiti paint strokes. Sticker graphics. Hand-drawn doodles. Japanese typography. Barcode labels. Magazine clippings. Torn paper effects. Retro web graphics. Pixel-inspired icons. Spray paint textures. Urban design details. Editorial Layout: Large artist name section. Automatically generated biography. Career highlights. Achievements. Interesting facts. Retro computer popup window with a short message inspired by the artist's personality. Decorative Japanese katakana rendering of the artist's name. Professional visual hierarchy. Dynamic asymmetrical composition. Luxury poster balance. No creator credit. No watermark. No official profile text. No unnecessary logos. Visual Quality: Ultra detailed. Highly realistic. Sharp typography. Professional graphic design. Premium collectible merchandise aesthetic. Luxury fashion campaign quality. Japanese street-art energy. Modern Gen-Z aesthetic. Pinterest-worthy. Instagram-ready. Museum-quality graphic design. 4K resolution. Vertical poster format. Aspect ratio 4:5.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17311_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17311_in0.png"]},{"i":4746,"text":"A premium commercial advertising poster for a luxury gaming keyboard launch.Central Subject:A single ultra-premium mechanical keyboard positioned perfectly in the exact center of the composition.Design Style:Modern technology branding mixed with clean editorial graphic design.Graphic Elements:Large overlapping translucent rectangles, subtle geometric frames, thin technical grid lines, and soft transparent acrylic panels integrated behind the keyboard.Typography:Huge bold typography reading:\"TYPE FASTER\"The typography is oversized, partially hidden behind the keyboard, and naturally integrated into the overall composition.Materials:Premium anodized aluminum chassis, matte black keycaps, subtle RGB glow between keys, realistic legends, brushed metal texture, precision-engineered details.Background:Clean deep graphite-black studio backdrop with subtle gradients.Lighting:High-end commercial product photography lighting, controlled reflections, crisp shadows, realistic metallic highlights, premium studio quality.Mood:Modern, premium, youthful, highly commercial.Composition:Symmetrical hero-shot layout.Strong central focus.Clean negative space.Professional advertising hierarchy.Color Palette:Graphite black,soft silver,electric cyan accents.Focus:Product design,materials,branding,commercial advertising.Aspect Ratio:9:16 vertical poster.Ultra detailed.Premium technology campaign.Photorealistic.8K.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17268_out.png"]},{"i":4747,"text":"Generate a vertical 9:16 cinematic visual poster with the theme of \"Social media interface materialization + characters breaking out of the phone screen + ultra-wide-angle close-up perspective impact\".\nAt the center of the screen is a giant smartphone, standing upright in the real world like a portal to a virtual world. The phone screen displays a fictional Chinese short video/social media profile page, its structure referencing common social media profiles: a top status bar, avatar, nickname, bio, number of likes, number of followers, number of following, number of fans, an edit profile button, tags for works/daily activities/recommended content, a nine-grid thumbnail of works, and a bottom navigation bar. The entire profile content is redesigned around the themes of Asuka and EVA Unit-02 and Neon Genesis Evangelion; the avatar, background image, work covers, floating cards, and recommended content are all related to the character's personality, story elements, and visual symbols.\nThe character Asuka is stepping out of the phone screen, half of her body still inside the screen, while the other half has broken through the screen's boundaries into real space. One of her hands reaches towards the camera, the palm positioned at the very front of the frame, creating a strong ultra-wide-angle perspective distortion; a foot or leg also steps out of the phone screen, approaching the viewer, generating a strong sense of 3D depth and a visually striking \"breaking the dimensional barrier.\" The character must appear to truly step out of the social media page, not simply stand in front of the phone.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17139_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17139_in0.png"]},{"i":4748,"text":"Vertical 9:16, minimalist white cosplay outfit information page, generous white empty space at the top and bottom, pure white photography studio background, bright high-key soft lighting, realistic commercial studio photography, premium fashion magazine catalog layout, clean and restrained.\n\nAt the top, a large bold black title reads: “MUSASHI”. Under the title, add a very small refined subtitle: “ROCKET GLAMOUR TRICKSTER STYLE”.\n\nThe left side is a unified black thin-line bordered outfit and accessory checklist, fixed into 3 numbered sections. Each section contains exactly 2 product cutouts, six product cutouts total: Section 1: long magenta wig with dramatic side sweep and black elbow gloves; Section 2: cropped white high-fashion rocket uniform top with red emblem-inspired abstract letter shape and white mini skirt; Section 3: black thigh-high boots and red rose accessory. Each item is shown as a clean white-background product cutout, with a small “1x” quantity label below each product.\n\nOn the right side, a clearly adult Asian female fashion blogger stands full-body wearing a luxury fashion reinterpretation of Musashi from Pokemon: long vivid magenta hair swept dramatically to one side, fitted cropped white uniform top, sleek white mini skirt, black opera gloves, black thigh-high boots, sharp red graphic detail on the chest, elegant villainous runway styling. Preserve the recognizable identity: magenta hair, white rocket uniform, black gloves and boots, theatrical confidence, mischievous villain-team aura. She poses with one hand on her waist and the other raised elegantly, chin lifted, confident and dramatic.\n\nBeside her on the right lower area, place one realistic Wobbuffet-inspired blue companion creature, standing slightly behind her boots, rubbery blue skin texture, simple expressive face, rounded body, small arms, black tail with tiny eyes, soft studio shadow, believable creature anatomy but still cute and recognizable. The creature should look realistic, not like a flat cartoon.\n\nAvoid cheap plastic cosplay, exaggerated anime filter, bad text, crowded layout, distorted body proportions, messy background, unofficial messy logo marks, and placing the character or creature too close to the bottom edge. --ar 9:16","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17005_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/17005_in0.png"]},{"i":4749,"text":"Capture a realistic screenshot from a fictional next-generation 3D open-world dystopian action-romance RPG, presented from the male protagonist’s first-person perspective.\n\nShinobu Kocho from Demon Slayer in a tattered butterfly-pattern haori and torn dark uniform that expose her cleavage, butterfly hair ornament, dramatic and somber cinematic lighting, leaning weakly against a crumbling stone wall in a destroyed, apocalyptic village. Her posture is fragile and exhausted—heavily wounded, shoulder line slumped, with visible cuts and burns, breathing heavily as if clinging to consciousness rather than striking a pose. Her face is smudged with ash, with a faint trail of blood trickling down her temple and reflections of distant embers in her eyes. A shattered, burnt wooden beam is propped against the debris beside her, casting harsh, jagged shadows over her upper body. Right beside her stands a cracked, blood-stained katana sheath driven into the scorched earth, next to a discarded, dirt-covered medical kit with spilled bandages—the debris, katana sheath, and medical kit must all be fully in frame; do not crop them out.\n\nThe overall visual style must feature high-quality cartoon-rendered 3D characters combined with Unreal Engine 5-level graphics, achieving AAA-quality visual fidelity. Include ultra-detailed character modeling, realistic skin shading with grit and sweat, cinematic lighting from smoldering ruins, PBR materials, high-precision battle-damaged fabric textures, and a finely rendered destroyed village environment. The final image must look like an actual playable game screenshot, including a complete game user interface: a malfunctioning or glitching minimap, an urgent crisis quest display, critical-low character status bars, emergency interaction prompts, tragic dialogue subtitles, HUD elements, and more.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16966_out.png"]},{"i":4750,"text":"Y2K Japanese video game magazine cover, fictional 2004 nightlife issue, ultra close-up high-angle portrait of an adult East Asian woman in her mid-20s, Japanese/Korean refined beauty, her face filling almost the entire frame, looking up through oversized glossy black sunglasses, wet glossy lips slightly parted, luminous skin under harsh nightclub flash, black shoulder-length hair, thin leather choker, one hand with black vinyl glove touching the edge of her sunglasses, oversized black blazer sliding slightly off one shoulder but still fully covering her body, subtle collarbone and shoulder line visible, complete opaque outfit, no nudity, nightclub neon reflections inside the sunglasses showing blurred dance-floor lights and a suggestive silhouette reflection without explicit detail, heavy halftone dot printing, xerox scan noise, CMYK misregistration, scratched ink texture, black background with green-yellow skin highlights, giant rounded futuristic masthead text across the top reading “SELENE”, small Japanese katakana labels, tiny technical production text blocks, vertical side typography, barcode, red warning sticker, fictional copyright marks, dense graphic design layout, PS2-era cyber fashion magazine aesthetic, intimate adult nightlife tension, stylish but restrained","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16416_out.png"]},{"i":4751,"text":"RETRO POP-ART BEVERAGE COLLAGE SYSTEM\n\nA premium commercial beverage advertising poster designed with a vibrant, playful mixed-media pop-art aesthetic.\n\nCentral Subject:\nA photorealistic, matte-finish aluminum soda can stands in the lower-center. The can features realistic condensation water droplets running down its side, with an elegant, modern branding label in pastel orange and teal.\n\nThe Aesthetic (Mixed-Media & Pop-Art):\nThe background is a solid pastel-teal backdrop. The realistic 3D can is surrounded by bold, flat 2D vector illustrations of orange slices, retro 70s-style hand-drawn sunbursts, and playful graphic splashes of juice in bright orange and white.\n\nDesign Elements:\nA mix of flat 2D graphic sparkles, halftone pattern overlays in the background, and 3D realistic mint leaves floating around the top of the can for a textured contrast.\n\nTypography:\nHuge, playful retro-serif typography in the background reading \"Zesty & Fresh\" in a bold cream color, layered behind the vector orange slices and the realistic can.\n\nLighting:\nBright, summery studio lighting, crisp soft shadows, realistic metallic reflections on the can, high-contrast fresh atmosphere.\n\nCommercial Value:\nHighly reusable for FMCG brands, healthy soda startups, organic juices, and summer social media marketing campaigns.\n\nAspect Ratio: 9:16 vertical poster format.\nQuality: Ultra detailed, 8K masterpiece, clean commercial rendering.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16316_out.png"]},{"i":4752,"text":"时尚杂志封面构图，中景人像，22-28岁东亚年轻女性，清冷御姐气质，凹凸有致身材，黑色长微卷发，淡妆红棕唇，穿搭藏蓝色半高领无袖紧身上衣+灰色高腰包臀半裙+竖线黑丝袜+黑色尖头细跟高跟鞋，人物侧坐黑色铁艺护栏，一手扶栏杆一手撩头发，单腿搭栏杆，直视镜头从容表情，场景为欧式老建筑沿街城市街道，晴天黄金时刻逆光自然光，清晰金色轮廓光，背景有行驶车辆零散行人，街道透视延伸，浅景深虚化背景突出人物，顶部叠加超大亮橙色粗体标题，柯达135胶片拍摄，轻微自然颗粒感，真实皮肤质感，冷暖对比，暖调环境冷调人物，高级时尚调色，电影感街拍。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16312_out.png"]},{"i":4753,"text":"Create a premium collector-edition character poster of [Long hair Future Trunks ] from [Dragon Ball Z].Character AnalysisAnalyze the character’s canon personality, emotional identity, visual symbolism, and dominant energy.Identify the character’s strongest archetype (heroic, calm, mysterious, aggressive, rebellious, strategic, etc.) and build the entire composition around it.Visual DirectionAnime illustration × contemporary poster design × premium branding artwork.Style ModeBlend luxury editorial aesthetics, futuristic cyberpunk design, urban street-art energy, and modern minimalist composition while keeping the character instantly recognizable.PoseCreate an iconic pose that reflects the character’s personality:• Heroic → confident elevated stance• Calm → relaxed elegance• Mysterious → concealed posture and controlled presence• Aggressive → forward momentum and tension• Rebellious → attitude-driven silhouetteFacial ExpressionEmotionally authentic, faithful to canon personality, highly expressive yet refined.OutfitReimagine the original costume as premium designer streetwear:• Luxury tailoring• Futuristic techwear details• Urban street-fashion influences• Simplified iconic character elementsPreserve the most recognizable features of the original design.CompositionVertical format ({aspect_ratio})Premium poster layoutStrong visual hierarchyOff-center positioningDynamic depthCollector-edition presentationColorsPure white backgroundCharacter signature color as dominant accentOne complementary secondary accent colorBackgroundMinimal architectural formsAbstract holographic elementsGraffiti-inspired graphic texturesClean geometric shapesLuxury branding aestheticsEffectsEnergy trailsPaint splashesGlitch fragmentsMotion streaksThin graphic accentsFloating visual symbols connected to the characterLightingProfessional cinematic lightingStrong rim lightSoft colored glowClean shadowsHigh contrast highlightsRenderingUltra-detailed anime artworkPremium branding qualityCollector-edition posterModern graphic design aestheticsSharp focus4K masterpieceCustomize this prompt with these user-specific details:Subject:[Long hair Future Trunks ] from [Dragon Ball Z]","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16194_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16194_in1.png"]},{"i":4754,"text":"Create a premium collector-edition character poster of [Long hair Super Future Trunks ] from [Dragon Ball Z].Character AnalysisAnalyze the character’s canon personality, emotional identity, visual symbolism, and dominant energy.Identify the character’s strongest archetype (heroic, calm, mysterious, aggressive, rebellious, strategic, etc.) and build the entire composition around it.Visual DirectionAnime illustration × contemporary poster design × premium branding artwork.Style ModeBlend luxury editorial aesthetics, futuristic cyberpunk design, urban street-art energy, and modern minimalist composition while keeping the character instantly recognizable.PoseCreate an iconic pose that reflects the character’s personality:• Heroic → confident elevated stance• Calm → relaxed elegance• Mysterious → concealed posture and controlled presence• Aggressive → forward momentum and tension• Rebellious → attitude-driven silhouetteFacial ExpressionEmotionally authentic, faithful to canon personality, highly expressive yet refined.OutfitReimagine the original costume as premium designer streetwear:• Luxury tailoring• Futuristic techwear details• Urban street-fashion influences• Simplified iconic character elementsPreserve the most recognizable features of the original design.CompositionVertical format ({aspect_ratio})Premium poster layoutStrong visual hierarchyOff-center positioningDynamic depthCollector-edition presentationColorsPure white backgroundCharacter signature color as dominant accentOne complementary secondary accent colorBackgroundMinimal architectural formsAbstract holographic elementsGraffiti-inspired graphic texturesClean geometric shapesLuxury branding aestheticsEffectsEnergy trailsPaint splashesGlitch fragmentsMotion streaksThin graphic accentsFloating visual symbols connected to the characterLightingProfessional cinematic lightingStrong rim lightSoft colored glowClean shadowsHigh contrast highlightsRenderingUltra-detailed anime artworkPremium branding qualityCollector-edition posterModern graphic design aestheticsSharp focus4K masterpieceCustomize this prompt with these user-specific details:Subject:[Long hair Super Future Trunks ] from [Dragon Ball Z]","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16190_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16190_in0.png"]},{"i":4755,"text":"Create a premium collector-edition character poster of [Beast Gohan] from [Dragon Ball Super : Super Hero].Character AnalysisAnalyze the character’s canon personality, emotional identity, visual symbolism, and dominant energy.Identify the character’s strongest archetype (heroic, calm, mysterious, aggressive, rebellious, strategic, etc.) and build the entire composition around it.Visual DirectionAnime illustration × contemporary poster design × premium branding artwork.Style ModeBlend luxury editorial aesthetics, futuristic cyberpunk design, urban street-art energy, and modern minimalist composition while keeping the character instantly recognizable.PoseCreate an iconic pose that reflects the character’s personality:• Heroic → confident elevated stance• Calm → relaxed elegance• Mysterious → concealed posture and controlled presence• Aggressive → forward momentum and tension• Rebellious → attitude-driven silhouetteFacial ExpressionEmotionally authentic, faithful to canon personality, highly expressive yet refined.OutfitReimagine the original costume as premium designer streetwear:• Luxury tailoring• Futuristic techwear details• Urban street-fashion influences• Simplified iconic character elementsPreserve the most recognizable features of the original design.CompositionVertical format ({aspect_ratio})Premium poster layoutStrong visual hierarchyOff-center positioningDynamic depthCollector-edition presentationColorsPure white backgroundCharacter signature color as dominant accentOne complementary secondary accent colorBackgroundMinimal architectural formsAbstract holographic elementsGraffiti-inspired graphic texturesClean geometric shapesLuxury branding aestheticsEffectsEnergy trailsPaint splashesGlitch fragmentsMotion streaksThin graphic accentsFloating visual symbols connected to the characterLightingProfessional cinematic lightingStrong rim lightSoft colored glowClean shadowsHigh contrast highlightsRenderingUltra-detailed anime artworkPremium branding qualityCollector-edition posterModern graphic design aestheticsSharp focus4K masterpieceCustomize this prompt with these user-specific details:Subject: {Beast Gohan} from {Dragon Ball Super: Super Hero}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16173_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/16173_in0.png"]},{"i":4756,"text":"Create a stylized AAA video game key art poster.\n\nCONCEPT:\n“Vice City 2026” reimagined — modern evolution of the iconic GTA Vice City cover art. Preserve the comic-panel collage identity, but upgrade with futuristic Miami, tech culture, and modern crime lifestyle.\n\nSTYLE:\nAAA game key art, Unreal Engine 5 inspired rendering + illustrated comic-panel hybrid\nBold black grid layout, sharp vector framing, stylized GTA-like characters (NOT real humans)\nHigh-saturation neon palette (magenta, cyan, electric blue, sunset orange)\n\nFORMAT:\nClassic GTA cover grid composition (multi-panel collage with thick black dividers)\nCentered stacked title typography\n\n────────────────────────────\n\n🧩 PANEL COMPOSITION (MODERNIZED ICONIC GRID):\n\nTop-left:\nPolice helicopter redesigned as a sleek surveillance drone chopper with neon accents, flying over futuristic Miami skyline\n\nTop-center:\nStylized male character (Tommy-inspired 2026 version) holding a smartphone instead of cash — crypto trading UI glow on screen\n\nTop-right:\nHigh-performance futuristic superbike (Tron-inspired neon trims), aggressive angle\n\nMid-left:\nStylized female NPC in modern beachwear (tasteful, confident), holding phone taking selfie with neon skyline behind\n\nCenter:\nLarge bold stacked title:\n“grand theft auto” (classic block typography)\n“vice city” in neon script\nAdd “2026” subtle tag integrated into script glow\n\nMid-right:\nLuxury hypercar (Infernus-inspired redesign), sharp LED strips, aggressive stance\n\nBottom-left:\nNew protagonist portrait (Tommy-inspired, older, dominant expression, modern outfit)\n\nBottom-center:\nHigh-speed car chase panel — car flipping mid-air with sparks, police drones + neon VCPD vehicles chasing\n\nBottom-right:\nStylized character (Lance-inspired 2026), holding futuristic weapon, confident stance\n\nAdditional small panels (optional fill-ins):\n- Jet ski cutting through neon ocean water\n- AI billboard with crypto ads\n- Nightclub silhouette scene with dancers\n- Beach lifeguard tower glowing neon\n\n────────────────────────────\n\n🎨 ART DIRECTION:\n\nColor:\n- Strong contrast neon palette\n- Pink/cyan split lighting across panels\n- Warm sunset gradients for beach panels\n\nLighting:\n- Hard comic-style highlights + UE5 glow effects\n- Neon reflections and rim lighting\n\nTexture:\n- Slight grain + halftone comic texture overlay\n- Clean vector edges with subtle 3D depth\n\n────────────────────────────\n\n🔤 TYPOGRAPHY:\n\n“grand theft auto” — bold white stacked block font (iconic style)\n“vice city” — neon script, glowing pink with cyan edge\n“2026” — small futuristic numeric tag integrated subtly\n\n────────────────────────────\n\n🎥 CAMERA / FRAMING:\n\nEach panel:\n- Dynamic angles (low-angle cars, close-up portraits, action tilt shots)\n- Cinematic composition inside each frame\n\n────────────────────────────\n\n✨ PLAYFUL DETAILS:\n\n- Crypto/AI billboards instead of retro ads\n- Police drones instead of only cars\n- Smartphone glow replacing old-school pager/cash vibe\n- Neon reflections exaggerated for game aesthetic\n- Subtle HUD/UI hints embedded in panels\n\n────────────────────────────\n\nRENDER DETAILS:\nUltra-detailed stylized assets, crisp outlines, vibrant lighting, clean separation between panels\n\nNEGATIVE:\nreal humans, photoreal poster, movie poster style, flat illustration only\n\nOUTPUT:\n--ar 2:3 --quality 2 --style raw","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/15839_out.png"]},{"i":4757,"text":"[SPOTIFY — LOST IN THE BEAT]\n\nAct as Spotify Creative Studio, AKQA, Buck, COLLINS, Pentagram and Media.Monks creating a Cannes Lions Grand Prix-winning social media marketing poster.\n\nThis is a premium Spotify campaign.\n\nThis is NOT AI fantasy art.\n\nThis is NOT a cyberpunk illustration.\n\nThis is NOT a floating-person poster.\n\nEverything must feel intentionally crafted inside Adobe Illustrator by a senior designer.\n\nCREATIVE PLATFORM\n\nLOST IN THE BEAT\n\nThe visual idea is simple:\n\nMusic becomes movement.\n\nThe entire composition should feel like sound physically pulling the layout apart.\n\nART DIRECTION\nUltra-clean premium design.\n\nLarge-scale typography dominates the composition.\n\nThe words\n\nLOST\nIN THE\nBEAT\n\nbecome the visual hero.\n\nTypography stretches, bends, compresses and flows as if affected by bass frequencies.\n\nParts of the letterforms subtly dissolve into waveform structures.\n\nCertain edges distort from vibration.\n\nNo cheesy glitch effects.\n\nNo fake AI distortions.\n\nEverything should feel deliberately designed.\n\nLAYOUT SYSTEM\n\nSwiss grid foundation.\n\nModern editorial layout.\n\nExtreme hierarchy.\n\nMassive oversized typography occupying 70% of canvas.\n\nNegative space used intelligently.\n\nPerfect alignment.\n\nHigh-end poster design aesthetics.\n\nLuxury magazine meets music culture.\n\nSPOTIFY BRAND LANGUAGE\n\nOfficial Spotify green.\n\nDeep black background.\n\nSubtle lime gradients.\n\nMinimal white typography.\n\nTiny Spotify interface details integrated naturally.\n\nMicro playlist metadata.\n\nSmall progress bar.\n\nTrack duration indicators.\n\nDesigner-crafted information hierarchy.\n\nNothing feels pasted.\n\nMUSIC VISUALIZATION\n\nInstead of generic equalizers:\n\nCreate elegant waveform ribbons.\n\nAbstract frequency curves.\n\nData-driven sound structures.\n\nBeautiful vector motion paths.\n\nDynamic rhythm patterns.\n\nEverything feels premium and intelligent.\n\nHERO SUBJECT\n\nNo floating character.\n\nUse only a tightly art-directed portrait.\n\nYoung contemporary artist.\n\nShot like a luxury fashion campaign.\n\nStrong expression.\n\nAuthentic attitude.\n\nMonochrome treatment.\n\nPlaced strategically within typography.\n\nFace partially interacting with letterforms.\n\nTypography and portrait feel designed together.\n\nTEXTURE\n\nIllustrator vector precision.\n\nSubtle grain.\n\nPremium print texture.\n\nModern editorial imperfections.\n\nLuxury poster finish.\n\nNo CGI energy swirls.\n\nNo liquid effects.\n\nNo random particles.\n\nCOLOR SYSTEM\n\n90% black.\n\n8% Spotify green.\n\n2% white.\n\nExtremely controlled palette.\n\nPremium restraint.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY\n\nMassive custom condensed sans-serif.\n\nInspired by Spotify Wrapped,\nNike Campaigns,\nModern Music Festivals,\nHigh-End Editorial Design.\n\nCustom kerning.\n\nCustom distortions.\n\nBeautiful hierarchy.\n\nTypography feels handcrafted.\n\nMOOD\n\nSophisticated.\nYouthful.\nCultural.\nModern.\nPremium.\nObsessively art-directed.\n\nThe kind of Spotify campaign that wins Cannes Lions and gets featured on Behance Graphic Design Served.\n\n1080×1350\n4:5 aspect ratio\n\nVector-first design.\nAdobe Illustrator aesthetic.\nPremium social media advertising.\nBrand campaign quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/15834_out.png"]},{"i":4758,"text":"A world-class luxury fashion editorial poster for XCLUSIVE, inspired by contemporary Korean luxury streetwear campaigns and high-end fashion publications. The composition features a massive oversized geometric typographic backdrop displaying the word “PRAJWAL” in bold architectural lettering, seamlessly integrated into the design as a dominant visual element. Typography appears sculptural, layered, and sophisticated, creating depth while maintaining a clean editorial aesthetic.\nAt the center stands a full-body fashion model wearing an oversized monochromatic black luxury streetwear ensemble, featuring premium tailored fabrics, refined textures, exaggerated silhouettes, and subtle designer detailing. The styling blends Seoul luxury fashion culture with avant-garde runway influences, delivering a modern, aspirational look. The model adopts a minimal yet expressive pose with effortless confidence, maintaining an elegant neutral facial expression that conveys exclusivity and sophistication.\nThe atmosphere merges Vogue editorial refinement with futuristic luxury streetwear energy, creating a campaign image suitable for a global fashion house. The environment is clean and uncluttered, emphasizing form, silhouette, and typography. Soft diffused studio lighting wraps around the subject, producing smooth gradients, delicate shadows, and premium fashion-advertising polish.\nColor grading is dominated by a sophisticated monochromatic palette, featuring rich blacks contrasted against subtle white, ivory, cream, and soft pastel highlights. The image maintains exceptional balance between minimalism and visual impact, with precise spacing, luxury branding aesthetics, and magazine-cover-level art direction.\nProfessional fashion photography, ultra-realistic, luxury campaign design, premium editorial layout, high-end graphic design integration, sharp fabric texture detail, immaculate styling, museum-quality print finish, global fashion advertising standard, Vogue Korea aesthetic, luxury streetwear branding, cinematic studio lighting, ultra-clean composition, photorealistic, 8K resolution, award-winning fashion poster.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/15833_out.png"]},{"i":4759,"text":"喜茶芝芝莓莓 + 亚洲美女 | 粉桃色渐变背景 [镜头] 极端广角低机位仰拍 \n人物 镜头从模特下方往上打，前景的手 + 喜茶芝芝莓莓，被极度放大，背景的人物被压缩，瞬间把产品拉成视觉中心，制造 \"手要冲出屏幕\" 的冲击力。 前后景分层: 前景 (产品 / 手) 100% 清晰锐利，背景 (模特) 做轻微景深虚化，拉开了画面的空间感。 动态姿态配合：模特身体后仰，手臂前伸，配合低机位，既拉长了线条，又强化了 \"向前递出产品\" 的叙事感，让画面不呆板。 [光影与质感] 统一色调渐变背景：没有多余元素，用柔和粉桃色渐变，既突出了产品，又和人物的服装色调呼应，整体和谐不杂乱。 影棚级柔光 + 硬高光：喜茶芝芝莓莓，同时保留柔和的过渡阴影，既保证了时尚大片的干净质感，又不会让画面发灰。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/15831_out.png"]}];